          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="SCHEMA NOTES&#10;• No FOREIGN KEY constraints exist. Dashed line indicates an application identity association only.&#10;• Students and courses are independent: no enrollment/junction table exists.&#10;• students.phone is unique on trim(phone), only when nonempty. students.email is not database-unique.&#10;• Administrator email primary keys use COLLATE NOCASE. SQLite permits NULL on these TEXT PK columns.&#10;• Integer primary keys use AUTOINCREMENT. CHECK constraints and indexes are on the next page." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="545" width="1000" height="185" />
        </mxCell>
